# The .py files here are runnable scripts (normalise, generate_sql, sanitize_pii,
# pii_residuals, test_pii_filter) and pii_filter is imported by three of them, so running any
# of them by hand drops a __pycache__/ into this committed artefact directory.
# validate.sh additionally sets PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 so its own run creates nothing.
# The repo-root .gitignore's __pycache__ patterns are path-anchored to .claude/scripts/ and
# scripts/geography/, so they do not cover this directory.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
